            "value" : "Chisel offre azioni per Comandi con cui comprimere i file in background o direttamente dal menu contestuale del Finder."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Chisel's save mode is set to a custom folder, but no folder is selected in its settings." : {
      "comment" : "Error of the Compress with Chisel action.",
